WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.599
Fictional complication.

00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:03.475
The hallway door feels hot.

00:00:03.475 --> 00:00:07.993
Ready.gov says keep that door closed and use your second way out.

00:00:07.993 --> 00:00:12.372
In this house the diagram labels the window as that second way.

00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:20.503
If you cannot get out, close the door, cover vents and cracks, call 9-1-1, say where you are, and signal at a window.

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:24.048
This picture does not certify a route in your home.
